OL,3,GNEWSAPrison riots and executions
OL,4,Afeatured in exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FLetters and photos documenting the Hull
OL,7,Fprison riot of 1976 will be part of an
OL,8,Fupcoming exhibition.
OL,10,FThe protest against alleged staff
OL,11,Fbrutality involved about 100 prisoners
OL,12,Fdestroying their cells, smashing doors
OL,13,Fand furniture, and throwing slates at
OL,14,Fpassers-by.
OL,16,FWithin These Walls, which will be in
OL,17,Fthe old governor's house as part of
OL,18,FHeritage Open Days, will include the
OL,19,Fgeneral history of the site, including
OL,20,Fprisoners' death certificates, artwork
OL,21,Fand smuggled weaponry.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
